WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
When the time comes, we will try to get together

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,920
Destined to be trampled under the feet of those who joined first, but

3
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:08,360
We supported the removal of Lin Feng from the first day

4
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,280
He obviously can't let go of this matter, you know

5
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:12,360
When has it been?

6
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:13,920
Can face be used as food?

7
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:19,080
If Lin Feng stood in front of me now

8
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:20,720
Tell me to kneel down

9
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:22,400
If you apologize to him, he can take me in.

10
00:00:23,620 --> 00:00:27,020
I can kowtow to him on the spot and then talk about it.

11
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:29,060
I didn't let you bring things to the surface.

12
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:31,480
We can carry everyone on our backs

13
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:33,360
Contact Lin Feng in private

14
00:00:34,130 --> 00:00:35,130
Let me think about it

15
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:37,900
Sister Chen Yao, please think about it slowly.

16
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:41,660
But the food on this list doesn’t wait for anyone.

17
00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:48,070
Sister Yao picked up her head

18
00:00:48,670 --> 00:00:49,710
Still missing a bundle of firewood
